in't happy yet, but I'm way less sad","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":352,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"We break up with lovers and friends, make love to the rumors instead","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":353,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Mom and dad, they have a good life, but what the hell am I gonna do with mine?","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":354,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"The world is getting bigger, but I feel like I am getting smaller","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":355,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Somewhere in the universe… someone's got it worse","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":356,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"The DJ is crying for help","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":357,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"You got older ’cause you're good at life","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":358,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Good musics still good, even if no one is watching","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":359,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"You cannot rush what cannot be timed","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":360,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"My favorite color is you","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":361,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Someone told me to be selfess, but we are helpless, without attention","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":362,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Come hang out, cause you're outta your mind","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":363,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Should I hang my head low, should I bite my tounge? Or should I march with every stranger on BlueSky to get it done?","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":364,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Can I love the art, when I kind of hate the artist?","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":365,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"I wanna be next up forever, but I don't know what's coming next","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":366,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"What doesn't kill you, makes you ugly","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":367,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Life gave you lemons, least it gave you something...","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":368,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"everyone always forgets about nibbles and nybbles","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":369,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Sometimes I wonder if the universe is just a giant simulation","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":370,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"1024 bits of wisdom","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":371,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"the human brain is composed of approximately 86 billion neurons","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":372,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"the human brain can store approximately 2.5 petabytes of information","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":373,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Tell me why you're all on my mind?","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":tr