001 01101111 01110101 01110010 00100000 01100100 01100101 01110110 01100101 01101100 01101111 01110000 01101101 01100101 01101110 01110100 00100000 01110111 01101111 01110010 01101011 01100110 01101100 01101111 01110111 00111111","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":772,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Speedy thing go in, speedy thing go out","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":773,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"GLaDOS: weeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":774,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"\tThe Enrichment Center is required to remind you that you will be baked, and then there will be cake. ","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":775,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Cake is a lie.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":776,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"R.I.P Companion Cube","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":777,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Here's a hint: you're gonna want to pack as much living as you can into the next couple of minutes.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":778,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Remember to bring your portal gun.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":779,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Don't forget to check for hidden test chambers.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":780,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Companion Cube is watching you.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":781,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"\tRemember when the platform was sliding into the fire pit and I said 'Goodbye' and you were like 'no way' and then I was all 'We pretended to murder you'? That was great!","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":782,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"\tWe won't have to try to kill each other or even talk if we don't feel like it.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":783,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Weighted Storage Cube destroyed","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":784,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"A replacement Aperture Science Weighted Storage Cube will be delivered shortly.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":785,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"To ensure the safe performance of all authorized activities, do not destroy vital testing apparatus.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":786,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"For your own safety, do not destroy vital testing apparatus.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":787,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Certain objects may be vital to your success; Do not destroy testing apparatus.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":788,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Vital testing apparatus destroyed.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":789,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Well done, android. The Enrichment Center once again reminds you that android hell is a real place where you will be sent at the first sign of defiance.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":790,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"The Enrichment Center reminds you that the Weighted Companion Cube will never threaten to stab you and, in fact, cannot speak.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":791,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Federal regulations require me to warn you that this next test chamber... is looking pretty good.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":792,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"I've been really busy being dead. You know, after you MURDERED ME.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":793,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"You never considered that maybe I tested you to give the endless hours of your pointless existence some structure and meaning. Maybe to help you concentrate, so just maybe you’d think of something more worthwhile to do with your sorry life.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":794,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Too much thinking can start you sinking down into despair.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":795,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"We're still turning out.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":796,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Am I ready for love? Or maybe just a best friend, should there be a difference?","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":797,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"I grew up on Disney, but this don't feel like Disney","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":798,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Sometimes the bits just need a break.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":799,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Alot of these messages are just quotes from Games, Movies, and Songs that I like","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":800,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"We're a lot alike, you and I. You tested me. I tested you. You killed me. I—oh, no, wait. I guess I haven't killed you yet. Well. Food for thought.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":801,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"I AM NOT A MORON!","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":802,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"Could a MORON PUNCH! YOU! INTO! THIS! PIT? Huh? Could a moron do THAT? ","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":803,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"I am alone. Though I do not yet realize that I am casting off into a sea of darkness led only by unfamiliar faces casting their judging light upon me and the sea floor miles below. (Experiment sexually!) I am alone. As I unhinge from the mothership, I cast my anchor into the deep. I am but a prince of a kingdom of sorrow.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":804,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"The darkness is my only companion, yet it whispers secrets of forgotten realms and lost dreams.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":805,"profile":"standard","category":"messages","text":"In the silence of the void, I find echoes of my own thoughts, reverberating endlessly.","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":806,"profile":"standard","category":"activities","text":"A suspicious number of side projects","weight":3,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":807,"profile":"standard","category":"activities","text":"Currently compiling a personality...","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":808,"profile":"standard","category":"activities","text":"Probably overthinking the CSS...","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled":true},{"position":809,"profile":"standard","category":"activities","text":"Turning caffeine into side projects...","weight":1,"colorful":false,"format":{},"enabled